In the illustrative embodiment, the user interfaces **522** are rotatably mounted to respective handle posts **478**. The user interfaces **522** are rotatable about 90° between a position where the user interfaces **522** face generally rearwardly, as shown in FIGS. **30** and **36**-**38**, and a position where the user interfaces **522** face generally upwardly, as shown in FIGS. 31 and 38. As used in the subject specification and claims, the user interface **522** is facing generally “rearwardly” when the user interface **522** is facing a caregiver standing at the head end of the apparatus **10** and facing toward the apparatus **10**.

